# chapter 10 (ch10:138-159), verbatim from the book. Merge it into YOUR project's .gitignore.
# Grep honours .gitignore, so what it lists stays out of Claude Code's searches (ch10:136).
# Careful with the last block: fixtures/ and *.csv also drop test fixtures and data you want in git.
# The chapter's next paragraph (ch10:161) says to name such files in your prompt instead. Delete those lines if you need the files.
# Build output
dist/
build/
.next/
out/

# Dependencies
node_modules/
vendor/
.venv/

# Generated code (the big context win)
*.generated.ts
*.generated.js
prisma/generated/

# Large data dumps
*.csv
fixtures/
seed-data/
